Inspect, resume or discard saved build/import/sync/instance inputs

Usage: empack pending [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list     List saved operations without network access or durable changes
  show     Show exact input identities and explicitly unknown metadata
  resume   Revalidate a selected recipe and request fresh workflow approval
  discard  Discard only this unchanged saved recipe; preserve downloads, content
           and recovery data
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --state-dir <STATE_DIR>  Durable operation and recovery storage, separate
                               from disposable caches [env:
                               EMPACK_STATE_DIR=/Users/zer0cell/production/rules/terminal/evidence/20261123T225211680511Z-journeys/work/empack/state]
      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>  Disposable cache root; previews only inspect
                               existing objects [env:
                               EMPACK_CACHE_DIR=/Users/zer0cell/production/rules/terminal/evidence/20261123T225211680511Z-journeys/work/empack/cache/empack]
  -y, --yes                    Run without prompts; unresolved content choices
                               still fail [env: EMPACK_YES=]
      --dry-run                Preview changes without publishing project,
                               instance or durable state [env: EMPACK_DRY_RUN=]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
